+ * happened.  GCMouse reports a press about 0.25 ms after the mouse, in order with
+ * its motion.  AppKit's copy reaches the main thread with the next display
+ * refresh (October 19, 2026: 3.0 ms after the press on average and up to 8.6 ms
+ * at 120 Hz), by which time motion from after the press has gone ahead of it.
